    "text": "Updated March 28, 2026, 2:28 p.m. ETThe Arizona Wildcats will face the Purdue Boilermakers in the NCAA tournament's Elite Eight.The game is scheduled for Saturday, March 28, 2026, at 8:49 p.m. ET.Viewers can watch the matchup on TBS or stream it via SlingTV and Fubo.Arizona enters the game with a 35-2 record, while Purdue holds a 30-8 record.The Arizona Wildcats play the Purdue Boilermakers in the Elite Eight of the NCAA men's basketball tournament in March Madness action tonight on TBS.Here's what you need to know about tonight's matchup, how to watch, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds, picks and predictions:What channel is Purdue Boilermakers vs Arizona Wildcats game on TV today, Saturday, March 28? How to watch Purdue-Arizona March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight game tonight liveThe Purdue Boilermakers and Arizona Wildcats will air on TBS Saturday, March 28, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingWhat time is Arizona Wildcats vs Purdue Boilermakers start today, Saturday, March 28? When is Arizona-Purdue March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament game tonight liveThe Purdue Boilermakers and Arizona Wildcats will play on TBS at 8:49 p.m. ET, Saturday, March 28, 2026. Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingHow to stream Purdue-Arizona game today, Saturday, March 28. Where to watch Arizona-Purdue March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament game tonight liveThe Purdue Boilermakers and Arizona Wildcats will stream SlingTV at 8:49 pm. ET, Saturday, March 28, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action with a free Fubo trial2025-2026 Purdue Boilermakers regular season record, Big Ten conference recordPurdue Boilermakers: (30-8, 13-7 Big Ten)2025-2026 Arizona Wildcats regular season record, Big 12 conference recordArizona Wildcats: (35-2, 16-2 Big 12)March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament bracket schedule of games tonight: Start time, TV channel, where to watch, stream every men's basketball game2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight March Madness games today, Saturday March 28(3) Illinois Fighting Illini vs. (9) Iowa Hawkeyes, 6:09 p.m. ET, TBS | Preview(1) Arizona Wildcats vs. (2) Purdue Boilermakers, 8:49 p.m. ET, TBS | PreviewWatch the NCAA Tournament on Sling2026 NCAA tournament Sweet 16 March Madness results Friday, March 27(1) Duke Blue Devils 80, (5) St. John's Red Storm 75 | Box score(1) Michigan Wolverines 90, (4) Alabama Crimson Tide 77 | Box score(2) Connecticut Huskies 67, (3) Michigan State Spartans 63 | Box score(6) Tennessee Volunteers 76, (2) Iowa State Cyclones 62 | Box scoreWatch the NCAA Tournament with a Fubo trial2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight round March Madness gamesSaturday, March 28, and Sunday, March 29.2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Elite Eight on Sling2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.",
